                        ],
                        "form": "die Weißbrote"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                        "entry_id": "2ff9d38c-9a1e-3989-96b5-522ef46e92ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Brot, das aus hellem Weizenmehl gebacken ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc12b24e-0b2b-4d32-83b0-c192dcf86e1a",
                                "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                                "text": "Weißbrot schmeckt gut mit Marmelade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5f82001-c8f0-4580-971b-803bec2672d5",
                                "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                                "text": "„Wir beeilten uns, ihm zu überreichen, was von dem Weißbrot übriggeblieben war, und sahen zu, wie er große Scheiben in den Mund steckte, die er mit einem mächtigen Klappmesser herunterschnitt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bcaf2ca-59f6-446a-8036-f31e65db223d",
                                "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                                "text": "„Sie hatte Weißbrot mit Rosinen gebacken, denn Staszek hatte auch Rosinen mitgebracht.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdd97f17-3799-4e8f-b329-d06c79e8c706",
                                "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                                "text": "„Jim saß am rustikalen Tisch und schlürfte Nescafé, stopfte Weißbrot in sich hinein.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5698fec-c777-4555-ad6f-6a0f6bc122ed",
                                "sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                                "text": "„Der vorletzte Satz wirkt Wunder, denn ein Hauch von Optimismus zieht in Papins Gesicht ein, und wir sehen, wie er Weißbrot in seinen Milchkaffee tunkt und entschlossen zum Mund führt, der sich ganz bereitwillig öffnet.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77ca13f1-6338-47f1-afd2-c9c8b4082a51",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ff9d38c-9a1e-3989-96b5-522ef46e92ab",
                        "source_sense_id": "6780f792-afcd-3a8c-abab-f237ac3481a3",
                        "source_sense_description": "Brot, das aus hellem Weizenmehl gebacken ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "white bread",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "white bread",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d72df04-a841-3592-a5e3-5cae80fb8bbf",
                                        "entry_id": "83cea6af-c68c-3d09-b2e7-92422352a9b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bread made from white flour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d9079f9-b9a0-4730-a996-92a7e7f98483",
                                                "sense_id": "2d72df04-a841-3592-a5e3-5cae80fb8bbf",
                                                "text": "Yes—just become a Communist, and things get all right. Deny your Christ and they will give you white bread in plenty and clothes to wear—\" He would hold his breath, would wonder and question: \"What is white bread? And who is Christ?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f10a12f-46af-44f3-b42a-8a1a05c6f92d",
                                                "sense_id": "2d72df04-a841-3592-a5e3-5cae80fb8bbf",
                                                "text": "At one time, when the commandant felt especially indebted, he sent the other officers out of his office and opened the safe. There it was, securely hidden, an entire loaf of white''' bread. He cut a large slice, wrapped it in newspaper and, beaming, handed this precious gift to Ildikó. \"Just for you. I, as the commandant, am entitled to some white bread,\" he said proudly. Ildikó was touched, not by the value of the gift but by the realization of the Russians' grave poverty."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2878004a-2ac4-3826-8cc4-d637645db118",
                                        "entry_id": "83cea6af-c68c-3d09-b2e7-92422352a9b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A white person, a person of European descent, a person who 'acts white'."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "slur",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "368dda8a-a05a-48f1-9b61-d43753c21da7",
                                                "sense_id": "2878004a-2ac4-3826-8cc4-d637645db118",
                                                "text": "Teyshawn wanted to yell whitebreads did it—fucking whitebreads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e10b415-bdd3-4ad2-8e0e-7734a1fefdc4",
                                                "sense_id": "2878004a-2ac4-3826-8cc4-d637645db118",
                                                "text": "evelyn. Fuck you, white bread.\nvincent. Oh, I'm white?\nevelyn. You don't act black.\nvincent. (smiling) And yet, people still treat me like I'm black."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "white bread",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8001b03-834a-38f4-8968-c06f03aee421",
                                        "entry_id": "fa7a3076-6b0e-3719-81f2-04466660eb96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bland, boring; flavorless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02b45eb0-7504-4c57-b62b-a527c6752529",
                                                "sense_id": "c8001b03-834a-38f4-8968-c06f03aee421",
                                                "text": "She's been living in her white bread world / As long as anyone with hot blood can / And now she's looking for a downtown man"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5aaaa172-8077-466d-b5b7-7cf1cf1f5716",
                                                "sense_id": "c8001b03-834a-38f4-8968-c06f03aee421",
                                                "text": "This is our chance to make a name for ourselves; to show that we're not just some piss-ant white-bread mountain town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95977519-4d56-473b-a303-e6dc86aaf045",
                                                "sense_id": "c8001b03-834a-38f4-8968-c06f03aee421",
                                                "text": "He’s always thought of himself as boring, “a white-bread suburban househusband.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92a880c8-b456-39dd-8737-89960936ac9c",
                                        "entry_id": "fa7a3076-6b0e-3719-81f2-04466660eb96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to white people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "slur"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46f0a915-cf39-41f5-8db5-c5b80622d191",
                                                "sense_id": "92a880c8-b456-39dd-8737-89960936ac9c",
                                                "text": "[Rudy] Giuliani is hedging a bit, but he's not the white-bread cop so many blacks expect him to be."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
